UID:event-assignment-1455052
DTSTART:20260429T045900Z
DTEND:20260429T045900Z
CLASS:PRIVATE
DESCRIPTION:---------------------------------------------------------------
 -------------------------------------------\nModule 6Assignment 8 - Please
  read the instructions and the case first before attempting this assignmen
 t! \n--------------------------------------------------------------------
 --------------------------------------\n\n Case Overview\n--------------\
 n\n*\n\nThis assignment is designed to ensure that you have carefully read
  and understood the Jinchang Case titled: “[A Startup Company in Supply 
 Chain Crisis.pdf] (https://canvas.illinois.edu/courses/63702/files/2129819
 5?wrap=1)” Please download the paper by clicking on the "PDF" link and r
 ead Section I. The Case\, i.e.\, the first nine pages of the paper.  \n\
 n*\n\nThe assignment focuses on your comprehension of the company’s back
 ground\, its products\, and the implications of recent greenhouse gas (GHG
 ) regulations on its operations.\n\n*\n\nIt must be completed individually
 .\n\n*\n\nThis is the first assignment related to the startup case. In Mod
 ule 8\, you will complete a second\, capstone assignment\, Case Analysis #
 3. By dividing the work into two parts\, we aim to help you engage with th
 e material early and reduce end-of-semester stress.\n\n*\n\nThrough this c
 ase\, you will develop essential data analytics skills and gain insight in
 to how companies adapt to evolving global regulations.\n\n  Instructions\
 n--------------\n\n* Except for Question 8\, most questions are conceptual
  and do not require calculations. Before you begin\, read the case thoroug
 hly and highlight key details.\n\n* Question 8 asks you to create a PivotT
 able and upload your Excel file containing the completed table. We provide
  the spreadsheet template in this module. Before you start the quiz\, down
 load the [Jinchang Case - Student Template.xlsx] (https://canvas.illinois.
 edu/courses/63702/files/21296698?wrap=1) spreadsheet and have it open and 
 ready. It contains both the dataset and step-by-step instructions for crea
 ting a PivotTable.\n\n* For those learners who are unfamiliar with how to 
 create a PivotTable in Excel\, we provide an [instructional video] (https:
 //canvas.illinois.edu/courses/63702/pages/a-video-guide-on-pivottable) [Ca
 nvas page] in this week’s module. Please watch the video before starting
  the assignment.\n\n  Academic Integrity and Honesty\n-------------------
 -------------\n\nAcademic integrity and honesty are essential and non-nego
 tiable at the University of Illinois. It is your duty to not only understa
 nd and abide by University guidelines (read Article I\, Part 4: Academic I
 ntegrity of the Illinois Student Code)\, but also to promote a culture of 
 ethical behavior within your group and class. Ignorance is not an excuse f
 or any academic dishonesty. Violations will be handled via Department\, Sc
 hool\, and University policies.\n\n  Next Steps\n------------\n\nIf there
  are more items to be viewed or completed in this module\, you can track t
 hem below.\n\nModule Item Completion (built in browser\, hidden in app)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Assignment 8 - Please read the instructions and the case first befo
