 Module 7Danshui Plant No. 2 Case Submission - Submission Link\n-----------
 --------------------------------------------------\n\n  Instructions\n---
 -----------\n\nThe instructions for submitting are as follows:\n\n* Where 
 applicable\, please enter in the requested amounts in U.S. dollars. (Note
  that in the case\, Exhibit 3 presents revenues and costs in thousands of 
 dollars.)\n\n* Feel free to round to the nearest dollar. Enter your answer
  in dollar amounts\, not in thousands of dollars. For example\, if your an
 swer is $76\,345 dollars\, enter it as 76345 instead of 76.\n\n* Note that
  there may be rounding differences that have occurred\; we're not going to
  make a big deal about that. The quiz is set up to allow for a range of an
 swers to be accepted as correct.\n\n* You will also upload your spreadshee
 t file and enter short statements for Question 15(a) and 15(b) as well.\n\
 n* Important: it is not acceptable to enter the words "see spreadsheet" in
  place of the requested answers.\n\n* After each submission\, you will rec
 eive feedback on whether your answer is correct or not for the quantitativ
 e questions (but not for the qualitative questions).\n\n* You are allowed 
 unlimited attempts before the deadline. The latest attempt will be recorde
 d.\n\n  Academic Integrity and Honesty\n--------------------------------\
 n\nAcademic integrity and honesty are essential and non-negotiable at the 
 University of Illinois. It is your duty to not only understand and abide b
 y University guidelines (read Article I\, Part 4: Academic Integrity of th
 e Illinois Student Code)\, but also to promote a culture of ethical behavi
 or within your group and class. Ignorance is not an excuse for any academi
 c dishonesty. Violations will be handled via Department\, School\, and Uni
 versity policies.\n\n  Next Steps\n------------\n\nIf there are more item
 s to be viewed or completed in this module\, you can track them below.\n\n
