DESCRIPTION:--------------------------------------------------\nModule 8Jin
 chang Case Submission - Submission Link\n---------------------------------
 -----------------\n\n  Instructions\n--------------\n\nThe instructions f
 or submitting are as follows:\n\n* Where applicable\, please enter in the
  requested amounts in U.S. dollars. (Note that in the case\, Exhibit 3 pre
 sents revenues and costs in thousands of dollars.)\n\n* Feel free to round
  to the nearest dollar. Enter your answer in dollar amounts\, not in thous
 ands of dollars. For example\, if your answer is $76\,345 dollars\, enter 
 it as 76345 instead of 76.\n\n* Note that there may be rounding difference
 s that have occurred\; we're not going to make a big deal about that. The 
 quiz is set up to allow for a range of answers to be accepted as correct.\
 n\n* You will also upload your spreadsheet file and enter short statements
  for Question 15(a) and 15(b).\n\n* Important: It is not acceptable to ent
 er the words "see spreadsheet" in place of the requested answers.\n\n* Aft
 er each submission\, you will receive feedback on whether your answer is c
 orrect or not for the quantitative questions (but not for the qualitative 
 questions).\n\n* You are allowed unlimited attempts before the deadline. T
 he latest attempt will be recorded.\n\n  Academic Integrity and Honesty\n
 --------------------------------\n\nAcademic integrity and honesty are ess
 ential and non-negotiable at the University of Illinois. It is your duty t
 o not only understand and abide by University guidelines (read Article I\,
  Part 4: Academic Integrity of the Illinois Student Code)\, but also to pr
 omote a culture of ethical behavior within your group and class. Ignorance
  is not an excuse for any academic dishonesty. Violations will be handled 
 via Department\, School\, and University policies.\n\n  Next Steps\n-----
 -------\n\nIf there are more items to be viewed or completed in this modul
 e\, you can track them below.\n\nModule Item Completion (built in browser\
 , hidden in app)
