DESCRIPTION:--------------------------------\nACCY 503Coursera MOOC 1 Deadl
 ine\n--------------------------------\n\nNo assignment submission is neces
 sary. However\, you must complete both MOOCs by the last day of the course
 . In order to pass this for-credit course\, you must pass both of the ass
 ociated Coursera courses and obtain a Coursera Certificate for each. Failu
 re to pass both of these components by the date listed in the course sched
 ule will result in a final grade of "F" for this for-credit course. You wi
 ll need to retake the course\, both Canvas and Coursera\, in its entirety 
 in order to graduate and will be responsible for the additional tuition in
 curred. Any team assignments will need to be completed individually when r
 etaking the course. Extensions will not be provided for either component.\
 n\n  Next Steps\n------------\n\nIf there are more items to be viewed or 
 completed in this module\, you can track them below.\n\nModule Item Comple
 tion (built in browser\, hidden in app)
