DESCRIPTION:-------------------------------\nCourse OrientationSyllabus Qui
 z\n-------------------------------\n\n  Instructions\n--------------\n\nP
 lease read the syllabus before you take this quiz. In order to unlock the
  rest of this course\, you will need to earn a grade of 100% on this quiz.
  You can retake the quiz as many times as needed.\n\nThe multiple choice a
 nd true/false questions and statements in this quiz cover essentials to kn
 ow for you to be successful in this course. There are five questions\, eac
 h worth 1 point.\n\nThis quiz is worth 5 points out of a total of 1\,000 p
 oints (accounting for 0.5 percent) for your course grade. You are allowed 
 unlimited attempts before the deadline and this quiz is not timed.
